<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 154-2 AT TEA VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 154-2 AT TEA VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 154 for two at tea on the first day of the first test against England in Auckland on Friday.</p>
<p>Score:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 154-2 (B. Pocock 54 not out, B. Young 44)</p>
